Recommends: php-sqlite3, php-sqlsrv | php8.4-sqlsrv | php8.3-sqlsrv | php8.2-sqlsrv
Description: Pohoda changes poller, cache and outbound webhooks
 Polls Stormware Pohoda (mServer lastChanges or MSSQL DatSave) for document
 changes, stores MultiFlexi-compatible changes_cache and record_cache
 snapshots, exposes a cache HTTP API (JSON/YAML/XML) and fans out webhooks.
